title: EuroSciPy 2027 in Leipzig, Germany
---
pub_date: 2026-10-09
---
body:

### EuroSciPy 2027 in Leipzig, Germany

The 2027 edition of EuroSciPy 2027 will take place in Leipzig, Germany.
The host is the
[Leipzig University of Applied Sciences](https://www.htwk-leipzig.de/en/htwk-leipzig).
The tentative date is August 2027.
More details to come soon.
